% Iron Oxide Nanoparticles -- portfolio demonstration project
%
% VERIFICATION NOTE
% -----------------
% Every DOI below was resolved against the Crossref REST API
% (https://api.crossref.org/works/<doi>) and the returned author, year,
% journal and title were checked against the entry. Two entries carry no DOI
% because none was ever issued: Scherrer's 1918 paper predates the DOI
% system, and JMLR does not mint DOIs. Nothing here is cited from memory.
%
% These are genuine literature references. They support the METHODS used in
% this project. They are NOT the source of any dataset -- all datasets are
% synthetic and generated by scripts/generate_synthetic_datasets.py.
% ===========================================================================


